{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "e8420e44-1f81-43a8-9135-f6aa62023970",
    "name": "TP2 DAOS - S04 Informes de resolucion - 6 casos",
    "description": "Ejecutar en orden. Requisitos: Spring Boot localhost:8083, MySQL, y un incidente EN_PROCESO. Configurar incidenteIdPreparado con su ID. El caso 01 resuelve el incidente; para repetir toda la colección preparar otro incidente EN_PROCESO o reabrirlo. Casos diseñados, no ejecutados en Postman.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "60322539",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/60322539-e8420e44-1f81-43a8-9135-f6aa62023970?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - Crear informe exitoso",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 201', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });\nconst loc = pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '';\npm.test('Location tiene ID', function () { pm.expect(loc).to.match(/\\/informes-resolucion\\/\\d+$/); });\nconst m = loc.match(/\\/informes-resolucion\\/(\\d+)$/);\nif (m) pm.collectionVariables.set('informeIdCreado',m[1]);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"incidenteId\": {{incidenteIdPreparado}},\n  \"descripcionTrabajo\": \"Reparacion verificada con Postman\",\n  \"costo\": 15000,\n  \"observaciones\": \"Prueba reproducible S04\",\n  \"responsable\": \"Tecnico de prueba\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/informes-resolucion",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "informes-resolucion"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Requiere incidenteIdPreparado existente y EN_PROCESO. Cambia el incidente a RESUELTO."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "02 - Consultar informe por identificador",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });\npm.test('ID consultado coincide', function () { pm.expect(String(pm.response.json().id)).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('informeIdCreado')); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/informes-resolucion/{{informeIdCreado}}",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "informes-resolucion",
            "{{informeIdCreado}}"
          ]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "03 - Listado filtrado por incidente",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });\nconst a=pm.response.json();\npm.test('Listado contiene informe creado',function(){pm.expect(a).to.be.an('array');pm.expect(a.some(x=>String(x.id)===pm.collectionVariables.get('informeIdCreado'))).to.eql(true);});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/informes-resolucion?incidenteId={{incidenteIdPreparado}}",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "informes-resolucion"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "incidenteId",
              "value": "{{incidenteIdPreparado}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
